        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T13:05:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point, moved mAdvertisers into each InterfaceAdvertiserRequest (the advertisers used by the request), and removed the old top-level to mAllAdvertisers (just for caching on creation). I had moved it out before and this wouldn\u0027t work...",
      "parentUuid": "e9d46156_d3008d99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 211,
