    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "258d192d_970dfff3",
        "filename": "service/mdns/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsAdvertiser.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 247,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308473
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-09T01:52:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why we need to do this because it change the service name which is different with user configuration. Does this follow up the spec?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 247,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 247,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "cea1e1967a431b1c62f529f4afce3006f7ce643f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b6a6e0cf_f15491b4",
        "filename": "service/mdns/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsAdvertiser.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 247,
      "author": {
        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T13:05:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes this follows our current behavior, and RFC recommendations. The service registration success callback won\u0027t be sent until the service has finished probing with its latest name, which is why CTS tests need a longer timeout for registration (see https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Connectivity/tests/cts/net/src/android/net/cts/NsdManagerTest.kt;drc\u003dd4ec70f7ec1d109fb92c552eac0064c625140d7a;l\u003d93), although in that case it\u0027s for the hostname and not the service name.\n\nAdded a comment.",
      "parentUuid": "258d192d_970dfff3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 247,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 247,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "cea1e1967a431b1c62f529f4afce3006f7ce643f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f27c2b55_e9cee5ac",
        "filename": "service/mdns/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsAdvertiser.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 295,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308473
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-09T01:52:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Don\u0027t we need callback for unregistration?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 295,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 295,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "cea1e1967a431b1c62f529f4afce3006f7ce643f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ac2503f6_dc495716",
        "filename": "service/mdns/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsAdvertiser.java",
